  "title": "Best Ever Jalapeño Poppers",
  "description": "Homemade jalapeño poppers full of gooey cheese and savory bacon bits are deep fried to golden perfections. These party poppers are hard to resist!",
  "authors": [
    "HLSANDS"
  ],
